WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
PlaceContext
Critical workflows. People in control.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Build critical workflows.
Website enquiry → right person · real workflow editor

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Open the code behind each step.
Inspect the validation job directly from the canvas.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Make every condition explicit.
Inspect AND conditions, payload fields and decision thresholds.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Review the evidence with AI.
Open the AI Review question that selects the True or False path.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Compose reusable workflows.
Open the Routing Review sub-workflow and inspect its stages.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Configure an independent review.
Inspect the AI evidence check and its review instructions.

8
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Coordinate parallel branches.
Inspect each branch’s condition and the workflows it starts.

9
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Define browser actions.
Review the workspace, instructions and execution settings.

10
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Put bounds on execution.
Inspect retries, delay and timeout for a workflow step.

11
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Keep the definition visible.
Open the workflow YAML alongside the visual editor.

12
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.000
PlaceContext
Open source. Self-hosted. Paid support.

